      "possibleRetry": false,
      "inputTokens": 405,
      "outputTokens": 2912,
      "costUsd": 0.0264105,
      "pronunciationText": "Now the second question. The tank held five litres at the start. Find the volume at time t. This asks for a function, so use the indefinite integral. V of t is e to the t squared, plus C. At t equals zero, that's one plus C, and it has to be five, so C is four. So V of t is e to the t squared, plus four. Here's a good check. V of one minus V of zero is e plus four, minus five, which is e minus one. It's the same amount as before, because the C cancels when you subtract."
    },
